[[Shelly]] is a [[Pet]] obtainable by combining a [[Health Potion]] with a [[Shiny Shell]]. It has a chance to enhance all cleanse effects, which is useful, but needs other items to be applicable except to its own ability, which is slow and therefore not really the best target. Fast-triggering items that cleanse small amounts of debuffs are best, like [[Amethyst]]s. Its heal and cleanse ability is often the main appeal of the item, since they are at substantial quantity, much larger than the original [[Health Potion]]. It takes a long time to trigger, but [[Potion]]s can speed this along significantly.

Because of the large effect, force triggering [[Turbo-Shelly]] with something like [[Amulet of the Wild]] can be very effective.

[[Shelly]] can be converted into [[Turbo-Shelly]] using two [[Flame]]s (normally only available to [[Pyromancer]]), which is an improvement across the board.
